 *   <li>If no input-prompt area found:
 *     <ul>
 *       <li>Spinner character in bottom 3 lines → {@link DetectedSessionState#WORKING}</li>
 *       <li>Otherwise → {@link DetectedSessionState#UNKNOWN}</li>
