/**
 * Behavioural tests for {@link StreamingState#processChunk(String)}: the OpenAI-SSE to
 * Anthropic-SSE streaming translation state machine.
 *
 * <p>Every assertion is made on the produced SSE text (event names plus the parsed JSON
 * payload of each {@code data:} line) and on the state accessors exposed by
